Column extras in the alignment row belong to that column's `<th>` only (§8,
OPEN-E1), while the alignment and the width cascade into every `<td>` of the
column. The alignment row's end-of-line extras belong to the `<tbody>`:

|-[layers]@@tableX{.striped}-|
||@@captionAB{.cap} Layer routing||
| A | B | C |
| :---@@cellA{.v-top} | :--- | :--- |@@tbodyX{.body}
|@@cellB{.lead} 1 | 2 | 3 |@@rowB{.info}
| 4 |@@cellA{.wide} > | 5 |
| ^ | 6 | 7 |
|===|@@tfootX{.total}
| Total | > | 9 |@@rowD{.row-danger}
